// Thread-Safe Immutable `CompilerDB` Snapshots (`ParallelSnapshot`, `SnapshotEpoch`),
// Module-Scoped `(ModuleId, LocalIndex)` Semantic IDs, Sharded Content-Addressed
// String & Type Interner (`ShardedInterner`), Single-Flight Query Deduplication
// (`InFlightLatch`), Cross-Worker Cycle Detection (`WaitForGraph`), and Work-Stealing
// Query Scheduler (`ParallelScheduler`, `--jobs <N>`) (T761 / E18.3).
// Implements SPEC-23 §1-§2 & §4 (AXS-PAR-001..005, AXS-PAR-010..015, AXS-PAR-023, AXS-PAR-050..053, INV-PAR-001).
module compiler.parallel.scheduler

